      ],
      "text": "The product is described as an LLM-based automated code review assistant that listens to PR/MR changes via GitHub/GitLab webhooks, analyzes code with AI, and posts review comments automatically."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_77a60106b50a8efcf8930d54d6c1044dbc5ed8dae3ac1fe253d9c87f22823919",
