      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_58f0d0da334ebed33f6834024c386119fb9cd339b34315f9f31d924b0036a6d4"
      ],
      "text": "A web admin panel at /admin and a RESTful config API under /config/* manage webhook secrets, tokens, LLM parameters, and notification URLs; API calls require an X-Admin-API-Key header."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_cbff012f3a7b26bf9641db0e59fabdfc3190c788db2c395a756ce8bbee7960a4",
