          "url": "https://github.com/Usagi-org/ai-code-review-helper/blob/d5fe002184e934d39c5032a584f23015cbc33919/README.md#L21-L42"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2a1722d86fc1737e5129488b86476d4db34abc4b594f10aa8d59a8b4b2acba92"
      ],
      "text": "The service posts review comments asynchronously, publishes a summary comment after all files are reviewed, and uses Redis to prevent duplicate reviews of the same commit."
    },
    {
